{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1000000000000001","type":"group","x":-100,"y":-100,"width":7100,"height":700,"label":"① 阅读入口：先建立一张总地图","color":"4"},
		{"id":"1000000000000002","type":"group","x":-100,"y":750,"width":7100,"height":900,"label":"② 手撕顺序：先骨架，再状态流转，最后链式解析","color":"2"},
		{"id":"1000000000000003","type":"group","x":-100,"y":1800,"width":7100,"height":1150,"label":"③ 运行流程：一次异步 Promise + then 到底怎么跑","color":"5"},
		{"id":"1000000000000004","type":"group","x":-100,"y":3100,"width":7100,"height":1500,"label":"④ resolvePromise 决策树：手撕 Promise 最难的一关","color":"3"},
		{"id":"1000000000000005","type":"group","x":-100,"y":4750,"width":7100,"height":1150,"label":"⑤ 三条分支流：值穿透、错误穿透、thenable 等待","color":"6"},
		{"id":"1000000000000006","type":"group","x":-100,"y":6050,"width":7100,"height":1300,"label":"⑥ 重难点、验证清单与面试复述","color":"1"},
		{"id":"2000000000000001","type":"file","x":0,"y":20,"width":500,"height":430,"file":"ProjectInCompany/travelKnowledge/我的整理/Vue Components Communication 整理/Promise寿司/Promise 手撕完整复习版.md"},
		{"id":"2000000000000002","type":"text","x":800,"y":20,"width":650,"height":360,"color":"4","text":"# 一句话总纲\n\n`MyPromise` 是一个可追踪的异步状态机。\n\n- 当前实例保存自己的状态和值\n- `executor` 通过 `resolve / reject` 回写结果\n- `then` 给旧 Promise 注册后续动作\n- 每次 `then` 创建 `nextPromise` 承接新结果\n- `resolvePromise` 决定新 Promise 最终成功还是失败"},
		{"id":"2000000000000003","type":"text","x":1750,"y":20,"width":750,"height":430,"color":"5","text":"# 推荐阅读顺序\n\n1. 先看手撕顺序主线，只记代码骨架\n2. 再看一次 `then` 的运行流程，理解数据怎么走\n3. 单独练 `resolvePromise` 决策树\n4. 最后用三条分支流理解穿透与等待\n5. 关掉原笔记，按验证清单默写\n\n不要一开始死磕全部边界；先让主链跑通，再补规范细节。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000004","type":"text","x":2850,"y":20,"width":800,"height":430,"color":"2","text":"# 必须先讲清的 4 句话\n\n1. 状态只能从 `pending` 改变一次。\n2. `then` 必须返回一个新的 Promise。\n3. 回调返回值必须交给 Promise Resolution Procedure。\n4. 成功、失败、普通返回值和异常都要继续向后传。\n\n这 4 句就是整份代码的设计约束。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000005","type":"text","x":4000,"y":20,"width":900,"height":430,"color":"6","text":"# 用“状态归属 + 触发 + 回流”理解\n\n- 谁持有状态：当前 `MyPromise` 实例\n- 谁触发变化：`executor` 中的异步任务\n- 结果传给谁：`resolve / reject -> #transition`\n- 怎么回流：触发回调队列，回调结果再交给 `resolvePromise`\n- 谁承接下一步：`nextPromise`\n\n口诀：**旧 Promise 给结果，回调做加工，新 Promise 接结果。**"},
		{"id":"2000000000000006","type":"text","x":5300,"y":20,"width":900,"height":430,"color":"1","text":"# 卡住时先改哪里 / 查哪里\n\n- 状态改乱：查 `#transition`\n- 异步前注册的 `then` 不执行：查两个队列\n- 链式值不对：查 `handleFulfilled / handleRejected`\n- 返回 Promise 后没有等待：查 `resolvePromise`\n- 错误没有继续传：查默认 `rejectHandler`\n- 死循环：查 `x === targetPromise`\n\n每次只沿一条链排查，不要同时改所有函数。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000010","type":"text","x":0,"y":900,"width":480,"height":500,"color":"6","text":"# 1. 定义状态与实例字段\n\n```js\nconst PENDING = 'pending'\nconst FULFILLED = 'fulfilled'\nconst REJECTED = 'rejected'\n```\n\n实例持有：\n- `#state`\n- `#value`\n- `#fulfilledQueue`\n- `#rejectedQueue`\n\n先把“状态放哪里”写清楚。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000011","type":"text","x":760,"y":900,"width":480,"height":500,"color":"5","text":"# 2. 写 constructor\n\n```js\nconstructor(executor) {\n  // 定义 resolve / reject\n  // try 执行 executor\n  // catch 后 reject\n}\n```\n\n触发点：`new MyPromise(executor)`。\n\n构造时立即执行 `executor`，同步抛错也要进入失败状态。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000012","type":"text","x":1520,"y":900,"width":480,"height":500,"color":"2","text":"# 3. 写 resolve / reject\n\n```js\nresolve(data)\nreject(reason)\n```\n\n它们不直接重复写状态逻辑，只负责把：\n- 目标状态\n- 成功值 / 失败原因\n- 对应队列\n\n传给统一的 `#transition`。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000013","type":"text","x":2280,"y":900,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"6","text":"# 4. 写 #transition\n\n核心顺序：\n1. 不是 `pending` 就返回\n2. 写入新状态\n3. 保存结果到 `#value`\n4. 异步刷新对应队列\n\n```js\nif (this.#state !== PENDING) return\n```\n\n这句保证状态只能改变一次。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000014","type":"text","x":3060,"y":900,"width":520,"height":500,"color":"5","text":"# 5. 搭 then 外壳\n\n先做两件事：\n\n1. 标准化回调\n   - 缺成功回调：`value => value`\n   - 缺失败回调：`reason => { throw reason }`\n2. 创建并返回 `nextPromise`\n\n这是值穿透、错误穿透和链式调用的基础。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000015","type":"text","x":3860,"y":900,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"2","text":"# 6. 判断旧 Promise 状态\n\n- `pending`：把两个 handler 放进队列\n- `fulfilled`：执行成功 handler\n- `rejected`：执行失败 handler\n\n这里回答：\n- 现在执行？\n- 还是以后状态落定再执行？"},
		{"id":"2000000000000016","type":"text","x":4640,"y":900,"width":500,"height":500,"color":"5","text":"# 7. 写两个 handler\n\n共同模板：\n\n```js\nrunMicroTask(() => {\n  try {\n    const result = handler(this.#value)\n    resolvePromise(...)\n  } catch (error) {\n    reject(error)\n  }\n})\n```\n\n区别只在调用成功还是失败回调。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000017","type":"text","x":5420,"y":900,"width":520,"height":500,"color":"3","text":"# 8. 写 resolvePromise\n\n按固定顺序判断：\n\n1. 是否循环引用\n2. 是否普通值\n3. 能否读取 `then`\n4. `then` 是否函数\n5. 调用 thenable 并递归解析\n6. 用 `called` 防止重复落定\n7. 捕获异常"},
		{"id":"2000000000000018","type":"text","x":6220,"y":900,"width":600,"height":500,"color":"4","text":"# 9. 收尾并测试\n\n补：\n- `catch -> then(null, onRejected)`\n- `static resolve / reject`\n\n测试顺序：\n1. 基础异步\n2. 链式普通值\n3. 返回 Promise\n4. catch 恢复\n5. 值穿透\n6. 错误穿透\n7. 循环引用"},
		{"id":"2000000000000020","type":"text","x":0,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"2","text":"# 触发：创建实例\n\n```js\nconst p = new MyPromise(executor)\n```\n\n当前实例初始化为：\n- `state = pending`\n- `value = undefined`\n- 两个空队列"},
		{"id":"2000000000000021","type":"text","x":760,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"5","text":"# constructor 执行 executor\n\n把当前实例专属的 `resolve / reject` 交给外部任务。\n\n外部任务可以同步完成，也可以稍后异步完成。\n\n同步抛错会被 `try...catch` 转成 `reject(error)`。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000022","type":"text","x":1520,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"6","text":"# pending 时调用 then\n\n`then` 先创建 `nextPromise`，再把：\n- `handleFulfilled`\n- `handleRejected`\n\n分别放进旧 Promise 的两个队列。\n\n此时不执行用户回调，只等待结果。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000023","type":"text","x":2280,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"2","text":"# 外部任务回写结果\n\n成功：`resolve(value)`\n\n失败：`reject(reason)`\n\n结果由 executor 回流给当前 Promise，而不是直接传给下一个 `then`。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000024","type":"text","x":3040,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"6","text":"# #transition 落定状态\n\n- 检查仍为 `pending`\n- 写 `fulfilled / rejected`\n- 保存 `#value`\n- 选择成功或失败队列\n\n从这里开始，当前 Promise 的结果不可再改变。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000025","type":"text","x":3800,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"2","text":"# 异步刷新对应队列\n\n`#runMicroTask` 遍历已注册 handler。\n\n- 成功只跑成功队列\n- 失败只跑失败队列\n\n另一条队列不会参与本次结果传播。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000026","type":"text","x":4560,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"5","text":"# handler 加工旧值\n\n```js\nconst result = handler(this.#value)\n```\n\n用户回调可能：\n- 返回普通值\n- 返回 Promise / thenable\n- 抛出异常\n\n所以不能直接 `resolve(result)`。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000027","type":"text","x":5320,"y":1950,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"3","text":"# resolvePromise 解析 result\n\n它不负责旧 Promise，而是根据回调返回值决定 `nextPromise`：\n\n- 何时成功\n- 成功值是什么\n- 何时失败\n- 是否需要继续等待"},
		{"id":"2000000000000028","type":"text","x":6080,"y":1950,"width":600,"height":380,"color":"4","text":"# nextPromise 落定\n\n`nextPromise` 有自己的状态和值。\n\n它落定后，下一个 `.then(...)` 重复同一套流程。\n\n链式调用本质：\n**旧结果 -> 回调加工 -> 新 Promise -> 下一次加工**"},
		{"id":"2000000000000029","type":"text","x":0,"y":2460,"width":1750,"height":360,"color":"4","text":"# Main Flow：异步成功主流程\n\n- 触发：创建 Promise 后，在 pending 阶段调用 `then`\n- 条件：executor 最终调用 `resolve(value)`\n- 顺序：入队 -> transition 成功 -> 刷新成功队列 -> 执行 onFulfilled -> 解析 result -> 落定 nextPromise\n- 状态变化：旧 Promise `pending -> fulfilled`；新 Promise 根据 result 决定状态\n- 结果：下一个 `then` 收到加工后的值\n- 结束：进入下一段相同链路"},
		{"id":"2000000000000030","type":"text","x":2030,"y":2460,"width":1400,"height":360,"color":"1","text":"# Branch：executor 同步抛错\n\n- 条件：执行 `executor` 时抛出异常\n- 顺序：constructor 捕获 -> `reject(error)` -> transition 失败 -> 失败队列\n- 状态变化：当前 Promise 变为 `rejected`\n- 结果：后续 `catch` 或失败回调收到 error\n- 结束：进入失败传播链"},
		{"id":"2000000000000031","type":"text","x":3710,"y":2460,"width":1400,"height":360,"color":"5","text":"# Branch：落定后才调用 then\n\n- 条件：旧 Promise 已 fulfilled / rejected\n- 顺序：不再入队，直接选择对应 handler，并异步执行\n- 状态变化：旧 Promise 不变，只创建 nextPromise\n- 结果：当前保存的 `#value` 继续向后传\n- 结束：回到 result 解析步骤"},
		{"id":"2000000000000032","type":"text","x":5390,"y":2460,"width":1400,"height":360,"color":"1","text":"# Branch：用户回调抛错\n\n- 条件：onFulfilled / onRejected 内部抛异常\n- 顺序：handler 的 try...catch 捕获 -> `reject(error)`\n- 状态变化：nextPromise 变为 rejected\n- 结果：错误交给后面的失败回调 / catch\n- 结束：进入错误穿透或恢复流程"},
		{"id":"2000000000000040","type":"text","x":0,"y":3280,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"3","text":"# 输入 x\n\n`x` 是 `then` 用户回调的返回值。\n\n目标：不是判断旧 Promise，而是决定 `targetPromise / nextPromise` 如何落定。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000041","type":"text","x":800,"y":3280,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"1","text":"# 1. 循环引用？\n\n```js\nif (x === targetPromise)\n```\n\n如果新 Promise 等待自己完成，就永远没有出口，必须立即 reject TypeError。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000042","type":"text","x":1600,"y":3280,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"4","text":"# 2. 普通值？\n\n如果 `x` 不是对象也不是函数：\n\n```js\nres(x)\n```\n\n数字、字符串、布尔值、undefined 等都直接让新 Promise 成功。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000043","type":"text","x":2400,"y":3280,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"3","text":"# 3. 尝试读取 then\n\n```js\nconst then = x.then\n```\n\n读取属性本身也可能触发 getter 并抛错，所以必须放在 `try...catch` 中。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000044","type":"text","x":3200,"y":3280,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"3","text":"# 4. then 是函数？\n\n- 不是函数：把整个 `x` 当普通对象成功返回\n- 是函数：把 `x` 当 thenable，尊重它自己的完成逻辑"},
		{"id":"2000000000000045","type":"text","x":4000,"y":3280,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"5","text":"# 5. then.call(x, ...)\n\n绑定 `this = x`，同时传入成功和失败回调。\n\n这里把完成控制权交给 thenable。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000046","type":"text","x":4800,"y":3280,"width":500,"height":380,"color":"2","text":"# 6. 成功值 y 递归解析\n\nthenable 成功后得到 `y`，不能直接 resolve：\n\n```js\nresolvePromise(targetPromise, y, res, rej)\n```\n\n因为 y 仍可能是另一个 thenable。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000047","type":"text","x":5600,"y":3280,"width":700,"height":380,"color":"4","text":"# 7. 最终落定 nextPromise\n\n- 找到最终普通值 -> `res(value)`\n- thenable 拒绝 -> `rej(reason)`\n- 读取 / 调用 then 抛错 -> `rej(error)`\n\n解析过程最终只允许成功或失败一次。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000048","type":"text","x":800,"y":3900,"width":700,"height":420,"color":"1","text":"# 循环引用分支\n\n```js\nconst next = p.then(() => next)\n```\n\n结果：\n- `x === targetPromise`\n- reject `TypeError`\n- 本分支结束，不再继续解析\n\n这是防止 Promise 永久等待自己的硬性防线。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000049","type":"text","x":1800,"y":3900,"width":700,"height":420,"color":"4","text":"# 普通值 / 普通对象分支\n\n两种情况直接成功：\n- 非对象且非函数\n- 是对象或函数，但 `then` 不是函数\n\n结果：`nextPromise` fulfilled，值就是 `x`。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000050","type":"text","x":3000,"y":3900,"width":900,"height":420,"color":"1","text":"# called 防重复落定\n\n不可信 thenable 可能：\n- 先成功再失败\n- 多次成功\n- 调用成功后又抛错\n\n`called` 保证第一次有效调用后，其余动作全部忽略。\n\n它保护的是解析过程只能落定一次。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000051","type":"text","x":4300,"y":3900,"width":900,"height":420,"color":"1","text":"# try...catch 分支\n\n可能抛错的位置：\n- 读取 `x.then`\n- 调用 `then.call`\n- thenable 内部同步抛错\n\n如果还没有成功 / 失败，则 `rej(error)`；如果 `called` 已为 true，则忽略后续异常。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000052","type":"text","x":5600,"y":3900,"width":1100,"height":420,"color":"5","text":"# 手撕决策口诀\n\n**同一个？拒绝。普通值？成功。对象函数？取 then。then 不是函数？成功。then 是函数？call。成功值继续递归，失败原因直接 reject。全程 called + try...catch 保驾。**\n\n先背判断顺序，再默写代码，不要反过来。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000060","type":"text","x":0,"y":4930,"width":1650,"height":720,"color":"4","text":"# Flow A：值穿透\n\n触发：\n```js\nMyPromise.resolve(42).then().then()\n```\n\n条件：没有传 `onFulfilled`。\n\n顺序：\n1. 用默认回调 `value => value`\n2. 回调返回原值 42\n3. `resolvePromise` 把 42 当普通值\n4. nextPromise fulfilled(42)\n\n状态变化：每一层都是新的 Promise，但值保持不变。\n\n结束：最后一个成功回调收到 42。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000061","type":"text","x":1950,"y":4930,"width":1750,"height":720,"color":"1","text":"# Flow B：错误穿透与恢复\n\n触发：旧 Promise rejected。\n\n没传失败回调时：\n1. 默认 `reason => { throw reason }`\n2. handler 捕获异常\n3. nextPromise 继续 rejected\n4. 错误向后传到 `catch`\n\ncatch 返回普通值时：\n1. `catch` 本质是失败回调\n2. 回调正常返回“恢复”\n3. resolvePromise 让下一个 Promise fulfilled\n\n结束：后续成功回调收到恢复值。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000062","type":"text","x":4000,"y":4930,"width":1750,"height":720,"color":"3","text":"# Flow C：返回 Promise / thenable\n\n触发：`then` 回调返回对象或函数。\n\n条件：它的 `then` 是函数。\n\n顺序：\n1. 读取 `then`\n2. `then.call(x, success, failure)`\n3. 等待 x 最终完成\n4. 成功值继续递归解析\n5. 失败原因直接 reject\n\n状态变化：nextPromise 保持 pending，直到被返回的 thenable 最终落定。\n\n结束：结果回流给 nextPromise。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000063","type":"text","x":6050,"y":4930,"width":700,"height":720,"color":"6","text":"# 快捷方法\n\n`catch(onRejected)`\n\n等价：\n```js\nreturn this.then(null, onRejected)\n```\n\n`MyPromise.resolve(value)` 与 `reject(reason)` 复用 constructor。\n\n注意：当前学习版 `static resolve` 没有完整吸收 thenable，这是与原生 Promise 的差距之一。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000070","type":"text","x":0,"y":6230,"width":850,"height":450,"color":"1","text":"# 难点 1：状态只能改一次\n\n真正守门的是 `#transition` 开头的 pending 检查。\n\n没有它，executor 同时调用 resolve / reject 或多次调用时，状态和值会被覆盖。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000071","type":"text","x":1100,"y":6230,"width":850,"height":450,"color":"1","text":"# 难点 2：nextPromise 的闭包\n\nhandler 内会引用 `nextPromise`，但 handler 被放入微任务后才执行。\n\n因此执行时 `nextPromise` 已完成赋值。手撕时不要把用户回调同步执行，否则会踩初始化时序问题。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000072","type":"text","x":2200,"y":6230,"width":850,"height":450,"color":"1","text":"# 难点 3：学习版的调度层次\n\n`#transition` 刷新队列时调度一次，handler 内部又调度一次。\n\npending 路径可能比已落定后调用 then 多一层微任务。核心链路仍成立，但不等于完整原生时序。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000073","type":"text","x":3300,"y":6230,"width":850,"height":450,"color":"1","text":"# 难点 4：为什么不能直接 resolve(result)\n\n因为 result 可能是：\n- nextPromise 自己\n- Promise / thenable\n- getter 会抛错的对象\n- 多次调用回调的不可信 thenable\n\n所以必须统一解析。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000074","type":"text","x":4400,"y":6230,"width":850,"height":450,"color":"1","text":"# 难点 5：两个“一次”\n\n- `#transition`：保护一个 MyPromise 实例只落定一次\n- `called`：保护一次 thenable 解析只接受第一次回调\n\n职责不同，不能互相替代。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000075","type":"text","x":5500,"y":6230,"width":1250,"height":450,"color":"4","text":"# 验证清单：每写完一层就测\n\n- executor 同步抛错能否 catch\n- resolve 后再 reject 是否被忽略\n- pending 注册的 then 是否执行\n- 已落定后注册 then 是否异步执行\n- 普通值能否连续链式传递\n- 返回 Promise 是否等待\n- 缺回调是否值 / 错误穿透\n- 回调抛错是否让 nextPromise 失败\n- 循环引用是否 TypeError"},
		{"id":"2000000000000076","type":"text","x":0,"y":6900,"width":2100,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"# 30 秒复述\n\n当前 Promise 保存状态、值和两个队列；executor 用 resolve / reject 回写结果；transition 保证状态只改一次并触发队列；then 标准化回调并创建 nextPromise；handler 加工旧值；resolvePromise 统一解析返回值，最后决定 nextPromise 成功或失败。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000077","type":"text","x":2500,"y":6900,"width":2100,"height":300,"color":"2","text":"# 默写节奏\n\n第一遍只写 1-4：状态机能落定。\n第二遍补 5-7：then 能注册和执行。\n第三遍补 8：链式返回值解析。\n第四遍补快捷方法和测试。\n\n每一遍都运行最小测试，不要一次写完整份再找错。"},
		{"id":"2000000000000078","type":"text","x":5000,"y":6900,"width":1750,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"# 最终心智模型\n\n**Promise 链不是一个 Promise 不断变形，而是一串独立 Promise：前一个落定 -> 回调产出 x -> 解析 x -> 后一个落定。**\n\n理解这句，`then` 为什么返回新 Promise、为什么需要 `resolvePromise` 就都顺了。"}
	],
